   "actionTime": "23:02:38",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Rules Committee Resolution H. Res. 306 Reported to House. Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 3005 with 1 hour of general debate. Previous question shall be considered as ordered without intervening motions except motion to recommit with or without instructions. Provides that the amendment recommended by the Committee on Ways and Means now printed in the bill, modified by the amendment printed in the House Report 107-323 shall be considered as adopted. Measure will be considered read. Bill is closed to amendments.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
